# Files NOT uploaded to Vercel when the site is deployed.
#
# admin/ is the founder's LOCAL-ONLY admin panel: an HTTP server with full,
# unauthenticated access to the production database. It must never reach a
# deployed environment, so it is excluded from the upload entirely — the files
# are not present in the build at all, which is a stronger guarantee than
# relying on Next simply never importing them.
#
# Belt and braces, in order of strength:
#   1. this exclusion (the code is not uploaded);
#   2. admin/ lives OUTSIDE src/app, so Next's router can never turn it into a
#      route even if it were uploaded;
#   3. admin/server.ts refuses to start when NODE_ENV=production or VERCEL is
#      set, and requires an explicit ADMIN_PANEL=yes (see admin/guards.ts).
admin/
